=== ch3_casio
@music off
INEZ: Let's see if it passes a tone.
She takes a keyboard down off a shelf, a Casio the length of an arm with a strip of masking tape across it: TEST TONES. DON'T.
She plays four notes into the line.
@sfx casio_E5
@wait 0.35
@sfx casio_Cs5
@wait 0.35
@sfx casio_D5
@wait 0.35
@sfx casio_B4
@wait 0.9
SOUND: Four notes. The tape's tune. It stops where the tape stops, on the one that wants something after it.
~ heard_casio = true
INEZ: That's the tape's tune. I never learned the end.
INEZ: Nobody on that tape ever gets to the end either.
* "What's the end?"
    INEZ: Couldn't tell you. Down one, probably. They usually go down one.
* "Play it again."
    She does. It stops in the same place, like somebody walking into the same door.
    INEZ: That's all there is.
* Say nothing.
-> ch3_archive

