=== ch3_inez_vm
~ heard_inez_vm = true
@vm_mark inez_test
SOUND: A click, then the frame room itself, recorded: relays, the hiss of the old board. Then her voice, younger by six weeks and exactly the same.
INEZ: Testing two-four-seven, from the frame. Fourteenth of August. Nobody's there, obviously.
INEZ: When I was nine this was the deep end. Mr. Pardoe used to count to ten with his hand on your head, and you'd come up when he got to ten, and the lights were on under the water, blue, and you thought you'd been down there an hour.
INEZ: That's what the line sounds like tonight. Clear. Testing done.
Blue light under water. Someone counting to ten.
if memory_shared == "pool":
    THINK: That's yours. That was yours. You told Jad it was yours.
else:
    THINK: That's the thing you had instead of a before. Blue light, and someone counting.
