=== ch3_teodor_look
@comp call
@set office
@cam teodor_eye
@view teodor
~ looked_teodor = true
Through him, the office is taller. He's sitting low, on the camp bed, and everything is above him: the edge of the desk, the lamp, the coat hook.
The coat is on the hook now. He's hung it by its loop, straightened the shoulders.
There's a paperback on the floor by the bed, a thriller with a bus ticket for a bookmark. The flask. A postcard of a tram stuck to the wall with Blu Tack, above the pillow, at the height a head would be.
It was a kind room, when Jad walked you into it. It still is. It's just more particular now. Somebody has made it into the room of someone who lived in it.
TEODOR: That's where the coat went. At home. On the hook, never in the wardrobe. He never once used the wardrobe.
~ k_office_his = true
-> ch3_teodor_talk

