@ring teodor
SOUND: Ringing. Three o'clock exactly. 5A.
* [answer] Plug in.
    @set building
    @cam main
    @acoustic flat
    @call teodor
    @view none
    ~ p_teodor_three = "kept"
    TEODOR: It's three.
    ARI: It's three.
    TEODOR: Goodnight, then.
    if told_teodor_not_him:
        TEODOR: Goodnight, Ari.
        He says the name like he's putting it down somewhere careful.
    TEODOR: Thank you for picking up. Nobody ever does. That was the point, before.
    @hangup
