=== ch3_sal
~ clk = 185
->> tick
@set lobby
@cam sal_desk
@comp room
@view plan
@reply_clear nell "Sal has stopped the countersigning while the forms are looked at. Nell doesn't need an answer to that one now."
@ring sal
SOUND: The lobby desk.
* [answer] Plug in.
@acoustic lobby
@call sal
@view none
@amb lobby_hum
SAL: Right. I'm not an idiot.
SAL: I've got nine forms here with the same contact, and the same handwriting in the contact box. Someone filled in nine forms. Neat capitals. Very neat.
SAL: If I don't see the people who signed them before six, all nine go void. The closure goes ahead anyway, because that's already signed off upstairs, and nine people have got nobody in writing.
SAL: So I need everyone who put Ari down, and I need you, and I need it before my bus.
* "Where?"
* "Why do you need me?"
    SAL: Because it's your name on nine forms and a packet with your appointment in it, and I'd like to read it to you before you sign it. I'd like someone to read something to someone, for once, tonight.
~ k_meeting = true
SOUND: A click on the line. A third person.
INEZ: The pool. Half three. I'll put chairs out.
SAL: Who's that?
INEZ: The exchange.
SAL: Why the pool?
INEZ: It's where the chairs fit.
@hangup
~ gap_n = 3
->> call_gap
-> ch4_start
